%S A398957 6,36,308,3030,32262,362010,4215744,50466324,617123238,7675302330,
%T A398957 96785463930
%N A398957 Number of fixed polyforms with n cells in the Josehedron honeycomb.
%C A398957 The Josehedron is the 12-face plesiohedron (4 triangular and 8 quadrilateral faces) introduced by Bernhard (2026); its honeycomb has 6 cell types, each cell face-adjacent to 12 others. Polyforms are face-connected clusters of cells, counted here up to translation.
%H A398957 Mathias Bernhard, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.07160">The Josehedron: A space-filling plesiohedron based on the Fischer-Koch S Triply Periodic Minimal Surface</a>, arXiv:2604.07160 [cs.CG], 2026.
%H A398957 Tyler Satchel Orden, <a href="/A398957/a398957.txt">C++ program and honeycomb tables for A398957,   A398958, A398959</a>
%Y A398957 Cf. A385028, A397707, A397708, A397709 (polyforms on other space-filling honeycombs); A001931 (cubic analog).
%K A398957 nonn,more,new
